# POLLY, factory_funk: factory style 2 (Funk) for a song (KNOB 4, Style, a step on from Pop), played over the Vamp
# template (Dm7 G7): the Intro, Main A, Main B, the fill (Fill BA), Main A, the ending; the audio in funk.wav.
wait 300
tap ENV
tap ENV
spin K4 1
wait 50
expect song1_style0 38
expect song1_style1 39
expect song1_style2 40
expect song1_style3 41
expect song1_style4 42
expect song1_style5 43
shot patterns.png
# Main A picked for a song with no chords: the style's tempo
expect tempo 100
press SEL
key w13 down
key w13 up
release SEL
# the engine takes the template at its next audio block (up to 5.8 ms): wait for it before looking
wait 10
expect template 13
hitreset
wav funk.wav
peakreset
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect sect 1
wait 9400
expect notes_out >40
press SEL
tapkey b2
release SEL
wait 9600
expect sect 3
press SEL
tapkey b3
release SEL
wait 2400
expect sect 5
wait 2400
expect sect 2
press SEL
tapkey b4
release SEL
wait 7500
expect playing 0
expect peak_db_max -0.1
expect peak_db_min -24
wavstop
